# ==============================================================================
# Web App — DO NOT create a local .env.local here.
# All environment variables are loaded from the root monorepo .env:
#
#   d:/Java/Bank/.env
#
# Run with:
#   npm run dev
#   (internally: dotenvx run --env-file=../.env -- next dev)
#
# See docs/ENVIRONMENT.md for the full variable reference.
